saa -- Streets and Alleys solitaire===================================    saa [ranks]Eight stacks of cards and a foundation for each suit.  A card may be movedfrom the top of a stack to its foundation (in suit, starting from the ace)or onto the top of another stack whose card is one rank higher; an emptystack takes any card.  Order every card onto its foundation to win.To move, type the source stack (1-8) then the destination -- 0 for afoundation, or another stack 1-8.  `?' prints the rules, `r' refreshes thescreen, `q' quits.  Give a number of ranks on the command line to play asmaller, easier deck (`saa 7' for a seven-rank game).Copyright 1991 John D. Ramsdell; permission to use, copy, modify anddistribute granted.  Originals in SRC/saa/ORIG.